        <activityName xml:lang="en">Panelling, aluminium, window frame cover, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Panelling, aluminium, window frame cover, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: f3f28c27-d1a8-3ac8-b40f-2c66bc92c83a
Included are the materials for the panelling of the frame of a wood-metal window. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f3f28c27-d1a8-3ac8-b40f-2c66bc92c83a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
